<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal leaves drain rate, offers repo.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal leaves drain rate, offers repo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal left its drain rate unchanged at 6.2 percent and offered a 10 billion escudo variable-rate repurchase tender on Friday.</p>
<p>Bids for the repo funds must be received by 1515 GMT.</p>
<p>Most analysts had been expecting the Bank to cut its drain rate -- the rate at which it absorbs excess money market funds.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
